# Local secrets, runtime data and real config files of the apps. Every Dockerfile runs
# `COPY . .`, so without this they would end up in the build stage and its layer cache.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/uploads
apps/*/config/*.local.json
apps/*/config/production.json
